# migration scratch (research clones, golden references, probe configs)
.research/

# Generated firmware and build trees.
.build/
firmware/

# NOTE on img/*.yaml and config/*-leader.yaml - neither is ignored:
#
#   img/*.yaml            intermediate `keymap parse` output. The local `just
#                         draw` recipe writes it to a temp file and deletes it
#                         (see Justfile), so it no longer accumulates here. It
#                         stays tracked because the upstream keymap-drawer
#                         workflow commits it with an explicit
#                         file_pattern of "img/*.svg img/*.yaml" and runs
#                         `git add` under `set -eu` - gitignoring it would make
#                         that `git add` fail and break the draw workflow.
#
#   config/*-leader.yaml  an INPUT to `keymap draw` (passed via
#                         extra_keymap_yaml), because keymap-drawer cannot
#                         discover leader sequences by itself. Must be
#                         committed.
